    },
    {
      "id": "callout_cache_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 230, "y": 1463,
      "width": 840, "height": 28,
      "text": "Cache-aside — IProductCache (CatalogService)",
      "originalText": "Cache-aside — IProductCache (CatalogService)",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900025, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900026,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "callout_cache_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 230, "y": 1497,
      "width": 840, "height": 200,
      "text": "Read path  (GetProductByIdHandler):\n   ① cache.GetAsync(productId)  →  HIT  →  return ProductDto  (no DB round-trip)\n                                  →  MISS →  repository.GetByIdAsync  →  cache.SetAsync(dto)  →  return\n\nWrite path  (UpdateProductHandler / ReserveStockHandler):\n   mutate aggregate  →  repository.UpdateAsync  →  cache.InvalidateAsync(id)   ← AFTER the save, never before.\n\nKeys:  catalog:product:{guid}      ·   TTL:  5 min absolute  (safety net for missed invalidations)\nCached unit:  ProductDto (immutable projection), not the EF entity — caching tracked entities is a footgun.\nList queries (GetAllProducts, SearchProducts) are intentionally NOT cached — paginated reads are colder, cross-page invalidation is harder.",
      "originalText": "Read path  (GetProductByIdHandler):\n   ① cache.GetAsync(productId)  →  HIT  →  return ProductDto  (no DB round-trip)\n                                  →  MISS →  repository.GetByIdAsync  →  cache.SetAsync(dto)  →  return\n\nWrite path  (UpdateProductHandler / ReserveStockHandler):\n   mutate aggregate  →  repository.UpdateAsync  →  cache.InvalidateAsync(id)   ← AFTER the save, never before.\n\nKeys:  catalog:product:{guid}      ·   TTL:  5 min absolute  (safety net for missed invalidations)\nCached unit:  ProductDto (immutable projection), not the EF entity — caching tracked entities is a footgun.\nList queries (GetAllProducts, SearchProducts) are intentionally NOT cached — paginated reads are colder, cross-page invalidation is harder.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
